        "Description": "[FULL BRIEFING BY ASHLEY ON HITMANFORUM]\r\rAfter looking into Roman Gribsch&apos;s legal disputes, it seems that he was always pardoned by the same person, Judge Joseph V. McCoy. Judge McCoy is responsible for the pardonings of killers, terrorists, and others through &quot;faulty evidence.&quot; Many of his pardoned have connections to the Mugen cult, so no doubt he is on Mugen&apos;s payroll, too.\r\rADDITIONAL OBJECTIVE: Destroy a MUGEN transistor radio in town.",
